<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "@drmichaellevin 25-law mathematical synthesis & biological-law-criteria suite (referee re-score) (None. No organism, tissue, cell population, specimen image or experimental dataset is loaded or compared; the claimed subjects (bioelectric collectives, GRNs, active matter) appear only in comments and law titles)",
        "@drmichaellevin 25-law mathematical synthesis & biological-law-criteria suite (referee re-score) faithfully reproduces None. No organism, tissue, cell population, specimen image or experimental dataset is loaded or compared; the claimed subjects (bioelectric collectives, GRNs, active matter) appear only in comments and law titles morphology" ;
