    dct:description "Proves how local stress-reducing coupling updates enlarge and deepen visited attractor basins, generalizing associative memory to dynamical systems | Variables: s ∈ {-1,+1}^N: network state; J_{ij}: interaction matrix; η: stress-relaxation learning rate" ;
    dct:source "Watson & Szathmary (2016) TREE 31:147; @drmichaellevin [K6cc6jbYQpY], [bujwU3pKc6c], [YGUwkKp_HYw]" ;
