    dct:description "Formalizes closed-loop target morphology homeostasis as active-inference Lyapunov descent across a Markov blanket | Variables: F: variational free energy; μ: internal morphogenetic state; s, a: Markov blanket sensory/active states; κ_μ: gradient rate" ;
