    rdfs:label "Law 5: Chvykov et al. (2021) Low-Rattling Fluctuation-Dissipation Attractor Selection Law" ;
    dct:description "Statistical-mechanics mechanism for why driven collectives self-organize into symmetric low-rattling ('Platonic') attractors (P_structural) | Variables: r_exit(x): state-dependent non-equilibrium exit fluctuation amplitude (rattling); P_ss(x): stationary probability; γ ≈ 1: rattling exponent" ;
    dct:source "Chvykov et al. (2021) Science 371:90; @drmichaellevin [mOWfZncXt_g], [K8BmMU1Tm-I], [k9lGNyPHurQ]" ;
